<title>UK: BayerLB sets 500 mln Ffr TEC10-linked bond.</title>
<headline>BayerLB sets 500 mln Ffr TEC10-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead managers J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN FFR   COUPON   **4.25	MATURITY    10.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.325   PAY DATE    10.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5	REOFFER    100.325   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR FIRST FIVE YEARS THEN TEC10 + 8 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
